      <p class="eyebrow">What is IRONFUEL?</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="about-title">Fitness education, <em>built on evidence.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">IRONFUEL is a fitness education brand. It explains how training, nutrition, supplements, recovery and progress tracking actually work, in plain language, so you can make better decisions about your own training.</p>
      <p>Our guides focus on practical knowledge and structured guidance. They are evidence-aware: they say what research supports, where the evidence is limited, and where advice is practical judgment rather than proven science.</p>
      <p>IRONFUEL is education, not personal coaching or medical advice. <a href="/disclaimer">Read the educational disclaimer</a>.</p>
    </div>
