      <div class="label-row"><span class="tag">Coaching advice</span><p>Practical judgment from training experience. Useful, but not the same as tested science.</p></div>
      <div class="label-row"><span class="tag tag--framework">IRONFUEL framework</span><p>Our own tools and methods: practical structures to apply, not proven interventions.</p></div>
